{
  "id": "project-LICHEN-worker6-fryb",
  "title": "Document v1-\u003ev2 trust-store migration rotation-floor reset window (or bump transcript domain)",
  "description": "Security review of yzir fix: a rotation applied while a store persisted as v1 (no sequence field) loses its floor on migration to v2 (trust.rs:801-805), so a captured pre-migration seq-1 K1-\u003eK2 authorization can replay after restart. Speculative (unknown whether v1 stores exist in field). Fix: document the window in migration notes/spec 8.7 and advise re-pinning after v1 upgrade; if v1 stores are known to exist, bump transcript domain to ...-v2 for post-migration rotations so pre-migration signatures cannot verify. New test trust_store_legacy_v1_migrates_sequence_floor_and_blocks_replay documents current floor=0 semantics.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
